      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Targeted, means-tested welfare is the only sustainable path because it preserves the work ethic and avoids the massive inflationary pressure that a universal UBI would inevitably cause.\nA blanket cash payment to everyone would destroy the incentive to work for low-income individuals and bankrupt the government during economic downturns.\nYou should recommend sticking with the current system, as it is far more efficient at directing resources to those who actually need them without destabilizing the broader economy.",
      "source": "target",
